  <notes>
    2026-10-04: gate met (UAC-r2 141 and 152 merged; escalation triggers 1 and 2 did not fire). OfficeService.CreateTodoAsync defaults sprk_assignedto to the caller's linked contact (IIdentityNormalizationService), warning todo_assignee_unset when none; never refuses. 3 tests added (+ factory doubles); seeded negative control red then restored; 18/18 Office/ownership, ArchTests 349/349, full suite 14,226/6/54 where the 6 are load-induced host-startup timeouts that pass 118/118 in isolation; CVE clean. No post-080 Office To Do lacks an assignee (3 exist, all explicitly assigned). OPEN: live check as Test User 1 (needs deploy) and publish-size delta (main session). Details: notes/083-office-todo-person.md.
  </notes>

